# <area>: <imperative summary under 72 characters>
#
# Areas include sgurr_cpp, nnue, testing, benchmarks, web, docs, ci,
# chore, release, nets, tools.
#
# Leave a blank line before the body. Include
#
#   - Why the change was needed.
#   - Measurements with error bars and game counts when available.
#     "+21.2 +/-8.7 over 4,000 games" not "improves strength".
#   - The bench fingerprint and whether it changed.
#   - What was ruled out and how.
#
# Wrap the body at 72 characters.
#
# Install this template with
#     git config commit.template .gitmessage
